        <h1>Slayer Exciter</h1>

        <p class="project-summary">
          Designed, characterized, and iteratively improved a high-frequency
          resonant Slayer Exciter that generated a high-voltage oscillating
          electric field capable of wirelessly illuminating fluorescent lamps.
        </p>
      </header>


      <!-- HERO IMAGE -->
      <div class="hero-image">
